{"name":"Illuminated","hex":"#f9e5d8","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"illuminated","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Irradiated by light, lit.","Decorated and illustrated."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of illuminate"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/illuminated"}],"entries":[{"title":"Illuminated (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Illuminated\" is a song by the British musical duo Hurts from their first album, Happiness, which was co-written with The Nexus. Initially charting on the UK Singles Chart at number 68 in September 2010 after a feature on Sky One's Unmissable Dramas promo, the track was released as a double A-side with \"Better Than Love\" as the fifth single from the album."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3c/Illuminatedfinal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illuminated_(song)","wikidata":"Q740910"},{"title":"Illuminated Film Company","blocks":[{"text":"The Illuminated Film Company is a British animation company founded in 1993 by Iain Harvey. It has produced the series Little Princess (2006-2020) and the ITV children's surreal comedy series The Rubbish World of Dave Spud (2019–2024) and other 2D-animated productions such as The Very Hungry Caterpillar & Other Stories, A Bear Named Wojtek, War Game and On Angel Wings."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illuminated_Film_Company","wikidata":"Q6000315"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"illuminated":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-AnotherFriendlyHuman-illuminated.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fa/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-AnotherFriendlyHuman-illuminated.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-AnotherFriendlyHuman-illuminated.wav.mp3"},{"type":"aud